{"ID":"20240506102353-0lzir0j","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506102353-0lzir0j","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102353-0lzir0j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102353-nc37umc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613095541-83ikp3s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:74,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613095942-0d4ban6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"289茵芋","type":"doc","updated":"20240823134451"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240629151026-fo3yc47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629151026-fo3yc47","updated":"20240629151029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629151026-6uyds5c.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629151709-g748es8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629151709-g748es8","updated":"20240629152448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 302px;","style":"width: 292px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629151709-c8g0x32.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 292px;\" parent-style=\"width: 302px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823133708-hnmpmdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823133708-hnmpmdn","updated":"20240823134142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 789px;","style":"width: 779px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茵芋"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茵芋-20240823133708-zvvfbdr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 779px;\" parent-style=\"width: 789px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 448px;","style":"width: 438px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茵芋 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茵芋 1-20240823134142-3g08a9q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 438px;\" parent-style=\"width: 448px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823134216-sotb030","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823134216-sotb030","updated":"20240823134451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茵芋 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茵芋 2-20240823134216-8ahc2cl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 489px;","style":"width: 479px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茵芋 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茵芋 3-20240823134451-4n4tink.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 479px;\" parent-style=\"width: 489px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629151953-y44wlbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629151953-y44wlbo","updated":"20240629152241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 837px;","style":"width: 827px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茵芋2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茵芋2-20240629151953-qaobfdl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 827px;\" parent-style=\"width: 837px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 377px;","style":"width: 367px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茵芋4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茵芋4-20240629152241-47si1p0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 367px;\" parent-style=\"width: 377px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823125144-0np54ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823125144-0np54ch","updated":"20240823125146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629152008-1a6gbd0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 753px;","style":"width: 743px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240629151747-69m1ezg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 743px;\" parent-style=\"width: 753px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240613095840-yj987y6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095840-yj987y6"}},{"ID":"20240613095851-c9xo30i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095851-c9xo30i","updated":"20240613095856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095851-vlkpv29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095851-vlkpv29","updated":"20240613095851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦温。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095851-jr2kb8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095851-jr2kb8o","updated":"20240613095851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主五藏邪气，心腹寒热，赢瘦如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095851-xxk93xt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095851-xxk93xt","updated":"20240613095851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：茵芋，一名卑共。微温有毒，状如莽草，而细软（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095851-n7mq1up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095851-n7mq1up","updated":"20240613095851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名莞草，一名卑共。生太山，三月三日，采叶阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095941-rjssjtq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095941-rjssjtq"}},{"ID":"20240613095942-0d4ban6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095942-0d4ban6","updated":"20240613095949"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095942-ee0p0bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095942-ee0p0bk","updated":"20240613095942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛温，有毒。生泰山川谷。春生苗，高三四尺，茎赤，叶似石榴而短浓，又似石南。四月开细白花，五月结实。今彭城、海盐、杭州、雍州、绛州、华州皆有，四月采叶，七月采茎，阴干用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095942-kuqadzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095942-kuqadzh","updated":"20240613095942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主五脏邪气，心腹寒热，羸瘦如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095942-wxmamtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095942-wxmamtf","updated":"20240613095942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋大毒，世亦罕用。《本经》虽有治羸瘦如疟状一语，皆是五脏有邪气，心腹寒热所致，非能疗虚羸寒热也。其治关节风湿痹痛，是其正治。时珍曰，《千金》《外台》诸方治风痫有茵芋丸，治风痹有茵芋酒，治妇人产后中风有茵芋膏，风湿诸方多用之。茵芋、石南、莽草皆古人治风妙品，近世罕知。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095924-g74sw81","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095924-g74sw81"}},{"ID":"20240613095925-1og7h9p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095925-1og7h9p","updated":"20240613095936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095925-1twdo5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095925-1twdo5a","updated":"20240613095932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋，出泰山川谷，今雍州、绛州、华州、杭州亦有之。春生苗，高三、四尺，茎赤；叶似石榴而短浓，又似石南叶；四月开细白花，五月结实；三月、四月、七月采叶连细茎，阴干用，或云日干。胡洽治贼风，手足枯痹，四肢拘挛。茵芋酒主之。其方茵芋、附子、天雄、乌头，秦艽、女萎、防风、防己、踯躅、石南、细辛、桂心各一两，凡十二味，切，以绢袋盛，清酒一斗渍之，冬七日，夏三日，春秋五日，药成。初服一合，日三。渐增之，以微痹为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095911-aie9pv1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095911-aie9pv1"}},{"ID":"20240613095912-7cifko6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095912-7cifko6","updated":"20240613095917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095912-nefm15o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095912-nefm15o","updated":"20240613095912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"宣、去风湿．"}]},{"ID":"20240613095912-n1qk08g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095912-n1qk08g","updated":"20240613095912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛苦微温．治风湿拘挛痹痛．（时珍曰∶古方治风痫、有茵芋丸、治风痹、有茵芋酒、治产后风、有茵芋膏、风湿诸证多用之、茵芋、石楠、莽草、皆治风妙品、世所罕知．）茎赤．"}]},{"ID":"20240613095912-hhdqua3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095912-hhdqua3","updated":"20240613095912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶似石榴而短浓．炙用．"}]},{"ID":"20240613095900-4mwlqw5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095900-4mwlqw5"}},{"ID":"20240613095901-hiufy2q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095901-hiufy2q","updated":"20240613095905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095901-d67vf4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095901-d67vf4g","updated":"20240613095901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦温。主五脏邪气。心腹寒热。羸瘦如疟状。发作有时。诸关节风湿痹痛。生川谷莞蒲茵蓐。比类差参。细萌银莽。密荫石楠。赤涂霞。白碎星含。解搜风痫。顿换春酣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095901-7u7mi55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095901-7u7mi55","updated":"20240613095901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"名医曰。一名莞草。诗笺。小蒲之席也。汉书传。车茵蓐也。韩愈诗。应对多差参。陶弘景曰。茎叶状银莽草而细软。日华子曰。形似石楠树叶。苏颂曰。春生苗高三四尺。茎赤。夏四月开细白花。李时珍曰。古人治风痫妙品。今人罕知。朱子诗。莫将寒苦换春酣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095840-bseqmxn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095840-bseqmxn"}},{"ID":"20240613095841-01e0xaj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095841-01e0xaj","updated":"20240613095845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095841-hchbb4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095841-hchbb4z","updated":"20240613095841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宣，去风湿"}]},{"ID":"20240613095841-sfd75qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095841-sfd75qi","updated":"20240613095841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛苦微温，有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095841-u6mnq16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095841-u6mnq16","updated":"20240613095841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治风湿拘挛痹痛（时珍曰∶古方治风痫，有茵芋丸；治风痹，有茵芋酒；治产后风，有茵芋膏。风湿诸证多用之。茵芋、石南、莽草，皆治风妙品，近世罕知。莽草辛温有毒，治头风痈肿乳痈疝瘕。苏颂曰∶古方风湿诸酒多用之，今人取叶煎汤热含，治牙虫喉痹甚效。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095841-xjdn82l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095841-xjdn82l","updated":"20240613095841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甄权曰∶不入汤）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095841-alhfafn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095841-alhfafn","updated":"20240613095841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎赤，叶如石榴而短浓，茎炙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095813-95xe0eo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095813-95xe0eo"}},{"ID":"20240613095829-tyvlqq5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095829-tyvlqq5","updated":"20240613095834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095829-0m21mwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095829-0m21mwd","updated":"20240613095829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛苦微温，治风湿拘挛痹痛。炙熟用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095813-j188o7m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095813-j188o7m"}},{"ID":"20240613095814-exrbkzy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095814-exrbkzy","updated":"20240613095819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095814-89av884","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095814-89av884","updated":"20240613095814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生泰山川谷。（别录）好者出彭城。（贞白）今雍州绛州华州杭州亦有之。春生苗。高三四尺。茎赤。叶似石榴而短浓。又似石南。四月开细白花。五月结实。三四月七月采茎叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095814-0mtl7dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095814-0mtl7dg","updated":"20240613095814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"晒干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095814-ui41e1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095814-ui41e1h","updated":"20240613095814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦温。有毒。治诸关节风湿痹痛。疗久风湿走四肢。脚弱。风毒拘急挛痛。并一切冷治风芋丸生〔论〕茵芋治风。主肝肾之损。能补风虚而透关节。即其气温。合于味苦。正以泻为补。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095733-h9z1fe4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095733-h9z1fe4"}},{"ID":"20240613095757-farr63p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095757-farr63p","updated":"20240613095803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《滇南本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095757-w17d723","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095757-w17d723","updated":"20240613095800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"茵芋"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，气味辛、苦，性温，有小毒。专治一切风湿麻木，手足拘挛，筋骨疼痛，左瘫右痪，用酒为引，其功甚佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095734-d3nriu1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095734-d3nriu1"}},{"ID":"20240613095744-7v9z6on","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095744-7v9z6on","updated":"20240613095747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095744-tz73r5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095744-tz73r5o","updated":"20240613095744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（毒草）治关节风湿痹痛"}]},{"ID":"20240613095744-4bb2cu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095744-4bb2cu0","updated":"20240613095744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋（专入肝肾）。本属毒物。味辛而苦。气温有毒。据书所述。治症多是风湿为用。如治风痫。则有茵芋丸。治风痹。则有茵芋酒。治产后风。则有茵芋膏。凡风湿痹症。多用茵芋。与石南莽草同为一类。（莽草辛温有毒。能治头风痈肿。乳痈疝瘕。其叶煎汤热含。能治牙虫喉痹。）若云能疗虚羸寒热。恐莫及耳。（因虚当兼补虚。）出彭城海盐。茎赤。叶如石榴而短浓者佳。取茎叶阴干。炙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095734-8q4j0fn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095734-8q4j0fn"}},{"ID":"20240613095735-36qbyvu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095735-36qbyvu","updated":"20240613095739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095735-nqo2y10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095735-nqo2y10","updated":"20240613095735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温，微温，有毒。主五脏邪气，心腹寒热，羸瘦，如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛。疗久风流走四肢，脚弱。一名莞草，一名卑共。生太山川谷，三月三日采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095537-f44qz45","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095537-f44qz45"}},{"ID":"20240613095721-y79tsav","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095721-y79tsav","updated":"20240613095729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095721-vmr17lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095721-vmr17lj","updated":"20240613095721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温、微温，有毒。主五脏邪气，心腹寒热，羸瘦，如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛，疗久风湿，走四肢，脚弱。一名莞草，一名卑共。生泰山川谷。三月三日采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095721-rhnesve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095721-rhnesve","updated":"20240613095721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶好者出彭城，今近道亦有。茎叶状如莽草而细软。取用之皆连细茎。方用甚稀，淮以合疗风酒散。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶苗高三、四尺，叶似石榴短浓，茎赤。今出华州、雍州。四月采茎、叶，日干。药性论云∶茵芋，味苦、辛，有小毒，能治五脏寒热似疟，诸关节中风痹，拘急挛痛，治男子、女人软脚毒风，治温疟发作有时。日华子云∶治一切冷风，筋骨怯弱羸颤。入药炙用。出自海盐。形似石南，树生，叶浓，五、六、七月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095721-4rq1irl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095721-4rq1irl","updated":"20240613095721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶茵芋，出泰山川谷，今雍州、绛州、华州、杭州亦有之。春生苗，高三、四尺，茎赤。药似石榴而短浓，又似石南叶。四月开细白花，五月结实。三月、四月、七月采叶连细茎，阴干用。或云日干。胡洽治贼风，手足枯痹，四肢拘挛。茵芋酒主之。其方∶茵芋、附子、天雄、乌头、秦艽、女萎、防风、防己、踯躅、石南、细辛、桂心各一两，凡十二味切，以绢袋盛，清酒一斗渍之。冬七日，夏三日，春秋五日，药成。初服一合，日三，渐增之，以微痹为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095537-jo4unon","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095537-jo4unon"}},{"ID":"20240613095712-cnsqhqq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095712-cnsqhqq","updated":"20240613095716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095712-sd70uyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095712-sd70uyu","updated":"20240613095712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温、微温，有毒。主五脏邪气，心腹寒热，羸瘦，如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛。疗久风湿走四肢，脚弱。一名芫草，一名卑共。生太山川谷。三月三日采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095712-m3pjig9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095712-m3pjig9","updated":"20240613095712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好者出彭城，今近道亦有。茎叶状如莽草而细软耳，取用之皆连细茎。方用甚稀，惟以合疗风酒散用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095537-85ge4p5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095537-85ge4p5"}},{"ID":"20240613095606-koykvtc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095606-koykvtc","updated":"20240613095612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茵芋《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095606-firxd6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095606-firxd6c","updated":"20240613095606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，温、微温，有毒。主治五脏邪气，心腹寒热，羸瘦，如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛。治久风湿走四肢，脚弱。一名芫草，一名卑共。生太山川谷。三月三日采叶，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095606-8jvxdgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095606-8jvxdgm","updated":"20240613095622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好者出彭城，今近道亦有。茎叶状如莽草而细软，取用之皆连细茎。方用甚稀，惟以合疗风酒散用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095537-medxcmf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095537-medxcmf"}},{"ID":"20240613095538-peteh57","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-peteh57","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：茵芋"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ps7y95f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ps7y95f","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-jqs4d0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-jqs4d0q","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yīn Yù"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-29c8h7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-29c8h7b","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-xgurmoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-xgurmoo","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黄山桂"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-8dvr8w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-8dvr8w4","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-am1cr5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-am1cr5n","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 芸香科"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茵芋"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Skimmia reevesiana Fortune，以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"叶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ryljb0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ryljb0x","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-kmikbz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-kmikbz9","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 东南沿海各省至湖南、湖北、广西、贵州。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-r5r7y91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-r5r7y91","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-r1q2hhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-r1q2hhr","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茵芋"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的果和叶均有毒，尤以叶为剧。误食少量引起轻度痉挛，大量引起血压下降，心肌麻痹而死亡。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解救方法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：若出现痉挛，可肌肉注射苯巴比妥，痉挛控制后，可洗胃与导泻。若血压下降则注射肾上腺素或苯甲酸钠咖啡因。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-2yzch45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-2yzch45","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-763p1od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-763p1od","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，温。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-pskxls9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-pskxls9","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-wv6wnou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-wv6wnou","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风胜湿。主治顽痹拘急挛痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-9huqoiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-9huqoiz","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-qgh04a7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-qgh04a7","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-hs3t27j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-hs3t27j","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-m9rdndc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-m9rdndc","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-g5dj8m3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-g5dj8m3","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：茵芋"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-4tud0le","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-4tud0le","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ryhbvll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ryhbvll","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yīn Yù"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-89g3qbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-89g3qbs","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-5voay7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-5voay7v","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 卑山共（《吴普本草》），莞草、卑共（《别录》），茵蓣（《千金方》），因预（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-dxswzqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-dxswzqb","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-4m4piyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-4m4piyn","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-cpks8su","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-cpks8su","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-e34jyvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-e34jyvx","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为芸香科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茵芋"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茎叶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-xqruf52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-xqruf52","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-f9etc57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-f9etc57","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于山中树荫下。分布山东、江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、湖南、四川、贵州、福建、广西、广东、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-wcd9yed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-wcd9yed","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-b46lsah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-b46lsah","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 茵芋，又名:黄山桂。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-1dey0km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-1dey0km","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常绿灌木，分枝，高约1米。叶常集生于枝顶，狭长圆形或长圆形，两端渐尖，长7～11厘米，宽2～3厘米，全缘，有时沿中部以上两侧边缘有疏浅缺刻，中脉在叶面浮凸，且密被微柔毛；叶柄长4～7毫米，淡红色。花常为两性，集生成顶生的圆锥花序；苞小，卵形；萼片5，广卵形；花瓣5，白色，有芳香，长圆形至卵状长圆形，端圆或钝，在花蕾时各瓣大小略有不等；雄蕊与花瓣等长，花丝丝状，花药广椭圆形；子房近圆球形，4～5室，花柱短，柱头头状。果长圆形，长10～15毫米，红色，有残存萼片。花期4～5月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ann8ye6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ann8ye6","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-wzte0qo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-wzte0qo","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《南方主要有毒植物》:\"茵芋，有毒部位，果和叶，以叶含毒较烈。中毒症状:误食少量引起轻度痉挛，大量则引起血压下降，心肌麻痹而死亡。解救方法:若痉挛时可肌注苯巴比妥，痉挛控制后可洗胃，导泻。若血压下降则注射肾上腺素或苯甲酸钠咖啡因强心剂等。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-n2hxh4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-n2hxh4y","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-wvoaxhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-wvoaxhm","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 叶含茵芋碱、茵芋甙、蔗糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-a6w54w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-a6w54w3","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-c9svlrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-c9svlrc","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 茵芋碱有麻黄碱样作用，可升高麻醉猫血压，增强瞬膜收缩，加强肾上腺素对血压及子宫的作用，加强猫或兔的在位子宫收缩，抑制小肠收缩及扩张冠状血管等。此外，还能提高横纹肌张力，加强脊髓反射兴奋性（去脑蛙的反射时的测定），这可能与中枢神经系统之兴奋有关；在切除肾上腺后，其作用仍可保持。它对神经节无作用，对可卡因无增强作用，对猫或大鼠的神经-横纹肌制备亦无显着影响，不翻转拟交感药的作用。其作用虽与麻黄碱有许多类似处，但强度较弱。小鼠在皮下注射600毫克/公斤以上时，可出现抑制，共济失调，但不致死亡。对蛙50～100毫克/公斤时可出现显著的兴奋现象，提高横纹肌张力，200毫克/公斤时则可致死。猫皮下注射50毫克/公斤，无明显变化。早年认为它是一种肌肉毒，可引起蛙肌强直，剂量较大，亦可抑制心脏肌肉；如静脉注射于兔，可引起心肌抑制甚至麻痹，血压逐渐降低，最终动物发生痉挛而死。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-bbm0woe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-bbm0woe","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-q884mgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-q884mgj","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草求真》:\"入肝、肾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-c1bbqs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-c1bbqs4","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-arw1elu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-arw1elu","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛苦，温，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-rzv740g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-rzv740g","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"味苦，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-86f40fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-86f40fa","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》:\"微温，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-yjm4jeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-yjm4jeg","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》:\"苦辛，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-n46h7f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-n46h7f7","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-agmgo1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-agmgo1z","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品有毒，内服宜慎。阴虚而无风湿实邪者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-x1lpfkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-x1lpfkq","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-sm232wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-sm232wa","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治风湿痹痛，四肢挛急，两足软弱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-kjwqj98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-kjwqj98","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"主五藏邪气，心腹寒热羸瘦如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-4fzt333","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-4fzt333","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》:\"疗久风湿走四肢，脚弱。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-i70w4kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-i70w4kc","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》:\"治男子女人软脚毒风，拘急挛痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ud664s8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ud664s8","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》:\"治一切冷风，筋骨怯弱羸颤，入药炙用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-dg09mgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-dg09mgf","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-3g7iwyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-3g7iwyn","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服:浸酒或入丸剂（生药一日量3～6分）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-fpzy4sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-fpzy4sv","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-2nw2ve3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-2nw2ve3","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治贼风，手足枯痹，四肢拘挛:茵芋、附子、天雄、乌头、秦艽、女萎、防风、防己、踯躅、石楠、细辛、桂心各一两。上十二味，切，以绢袋盛，清酒一斟渍之，冬七日，夏三日，春、秋五日。药成初服一合，日三，渐增之，以微痹为度。（《百病方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-frio86j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-frio86j","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治风气积滞成脚气，常觉微肿，发则或痛:茵芋叶（锉，炒）、薏苡仁各半两，郁李仁（去皮、尖，微炒）一两，牵牛子三两（生取末一两半）。上研细末，炼蜜丸，如梧子大。每服二十丸，五更姜枣汤下，未利加至三十丸，日三，快利为度，白粥补。（《本事方》茵芋丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-d2po475","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-d2po475","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ie9lf94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ie9lf94","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》:\"《千金》、《外台》诸古方，治风痫有茵芋丸，治风痹有茵芋酒，治妇人产后中风有茵芋膏，风湿诸方多用之。茵芋、石南、莽草，皆古人治风妙品，而近世罕知，亦医家疏缺也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-mw3ce3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-mw3ce3v","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》:\"茵芋大毒，世亦罕用。《本经》虽有治羸瘦如疟状一语，皆是五脏有邪气，心腹寒热所致，非能疗虚羸寒热也。其治关节风湿痹痛，是其正治。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ng949mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ng949mv","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-kcdotbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-kcdotbd","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-pr11kv8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-pr11kv8","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：茵芋"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-f6i2r7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-f6i2r7a","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-jc5t769","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-jc5t769","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Yīn Yù"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-6ladi8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-6ladi8q","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-gfud6h1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-gfud6h1","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 卑山共、莞草、卑共、茵蓣、因预。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-n812lra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-n812lra","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ifdtegv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ifdtegv","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Stem aor leaf of Reeves Skimmia"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-vhm0bl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-vhm0bl2","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-36l2i4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-36l2i4f","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-l5wakhu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-l5wakhu","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240613095538-lbrw3r2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-lbrw3r2","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240613095538-38skagq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-38skagq","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶弘景：茵芋好者出彭城，今近道亦有。，取用之皆连细茎，方用甚稀，惟以合疗风酒散。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-u4el9ey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-u4el9ey","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草图经》：茵芋出泰山川谷，今雍州、绛州、华州、杭州亦有之。春生苗高三、四尺，茎赤，叶似石榴而短厚，又似石楠叶，四月开细白花，五月结实。三月、四月、七月采叶连细茎阴干用，或云日干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-c0fii1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-c0fii1k","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《南方主要有毒植物》：茵芋，有毒部位，果和叶，以叶含毒较烈。中毒症状：误食少量引"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-x04c7q4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-x04c7q4","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-v3r0hq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-v3r0hq9","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为芸香科植物茵芋或乔木茵芋茎叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-bud0nom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-bud0nom","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Skimmia reevesiana Fort.2.Skimmia arborescens T.Anders."}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-s7ugep9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-s7ugep9","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采收，茎叶切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-pf5gjt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-pf5gjt6","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-9l7d60s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-9l7d60s","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生于树阴下。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-63sefym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-63sefym","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于海拔较高林下。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-9lk3rqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-9lk3rqy","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于华东、西南及台湾、湖北、湖南、广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-k60zgxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-k60zgxk","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于广东、广西、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-k33dlwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-k33dlwk","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-w5slszp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-w5slszp","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.全株有芳香。单叶互生，常集生于枝顶；叶柄长4-10mm，绿色或淡红色；叶片革质，具腺点，长椭圆状披针形或披针形，稀为倒披针形，长7-11cm，宽2-3cm，先端渐尖，基部楔形，全缘或有有时中部以上有疏而浅的锯齿，上面深绿色，主脉上密被短柔毛，下面淡绿色，主脉于上面稍隆起，侧卧不明显，无毛。花常为两性，白色，芳香；苞片小，卵形；萼片5，广卵形；花瓣5，长圆形至卵状长圆形，长3-5mm，在花蕾时各瓣大小略有不等；雄蕊5，与花瓣等长或较长；子房上位，近圆球形，4-5室，花柱短，柱头头状。浆果状核果，长圆形至卵状长圆形，长10-15mm，红色，有残存花萼。花期4-5月，果期10-12月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-6a2y7mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-6a2y7mq","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．乔木茵芋 常绿小乔木，高3-7m。单叶互生，常集生于枝顶；叶柄长1.2-2cm；叶片纸质，长圆形或为倒披针形，长8-18cm，宽2.5-6cm，先端长渐尖，基部楔形，全缘，干后表面中脉微凸，侧脉清晰，两面无毛。聚伞状圆锥花序顶生，长2-4cm，花轴被徽柔毛；花为杂性；苞片小，广卵形；萼片5，卵形；花瓣5，白或黄色，倒卵形或倒卵状长圆形，长4-5mm；雄花的雄蕊较花瓣长，退化雌蕊长2-4mm，先端3深裂；两性花的雄蕊比花瓣略短；雌花的不育雄蕊比花瓣短，花丝细小，子房近圆球形，花柱长约1mm，柱头增大。浆果状核果，圆球形，直径6-8mm，黑色。花期4-6月，果期7-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-jdgwgi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-jdgwgi7","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-mtn6lqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-mtn6lqa","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 茎皮和根含呋喃喹啉生物碱7-异戊烯氧基-γ-崖椒碱（7-isopentenyloxy-γ-fagarine），茵芋碱（skimmianine），单叶芸香品碱（haplopine），吴茱萸定碱（evodine），吴茱萸素（evoxine，茵芋宁碱（reevesianine） A，B；香豆精化合物7-异戊烯氧基-8-异戊烯基香豆精（7-isopentenyloxy-8-isopentenyl coumain），橙皮油内酯（aurapten），欧芹酚甲醚（osthol），异橙皮内酯（isomer-anzin），野栓翅芹素（pranferin），R-（-）-二氢山芹醇[R-（-）-columbianetin]，伞形花内酯（umbelliferone），橙皮内酯水合物（meranzin hydrate）和茵芋甙（skimmin）。叶含茵芋甙和茵芋碱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-jocrjjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-jocrjjv","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-vbl9zsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-vbl9zsk","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 茵芋碱有麻黄碱样作用，可升高麻醉猫血压，增强瞬膜收缩，加强肾上腺素对血压及子宫的作用，加强猫或兔的在位子宫收缩，抑制小肠收缩及扩张冠状血管等。此外，还能提高横纹肌张力，加强脊髓反射兴奋性（去脑蛙的反射时的测定），这可能与中枢神经系统之兴奋有关；在切除肾上腺后，其作用仍可保持。它对神经节无作用，对可卡因无增强作用，对猫或大鼠的神经一横纹肌制备亦无显着影响，不翻转拟交感药的作用。其作用虽与麻黄碱有许多类似处，但强度较弱。小鼠在皮下注射600mg/ kg似上时，可出现抑制，共济失调，但不致死亡。对蛙50-100mg/kg时可出现显着的兴奋现象。提高横纹肌张力、200mg/ kg时则可致死。猫皮下注射50mg/kg，无明显变化。早年认为它是一种肌肉毒，可引起蛙肌强直，剂量较大，亦可抑制心脏肌肉；如静脉注射于兔，可引起心肌抑制甚至麻痹，血压逐渐降低，最终动物发生痉挛而死。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-4zhkfx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-4zhkfx3","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ep8pj8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ep8pj8z","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；肾"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-oz1n3p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-oz1n3p6","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-zlli3ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-zlli3ca","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛；苦；性温；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-vz6c5e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-vz6c5e8","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-jlwyf5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-jlwyf5h","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品有毒,内服宜慎。阴虚而无风湿实邪者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-btg0y42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-btg0y42","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ckuvuqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ckuvuqx","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛风胜湿。主风湿痹痛；四肢挛急；两足软弱"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ki3j92i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ki3j92i","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-l9rxisj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-l9rxisj","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：浸酒或入丸剂，0.9-1.8g。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-cxvhh2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-cxvhh2q","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-o6qf0jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-o6qf0jp","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：《千金》、《外台》诸古方，治风痫有茵芋丸，治风痹有茵芋酒，治妇人产后中风有茵芋膏，风湿诸方多用之。茵芋、石南、莽草，皆古人治风妙品，而近世罕知，亦医家疏缺也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-1vjx9sl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-1vjx9sl","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经逢原》：茵芋大毒，世亦罕用。《本经》虽有治赢瘦如疟状一语，皆是五脏有邪气，心腹寒热所致，非能疗虚赢寒热也。其治关节风湿痹痛，是其正治。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-qaoqbia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-qaoqbia","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》： 主五藏邪气，心腹寒热赢瘦如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-hi15azq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-hi15azq","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：疗久风湿走四肢，脚弱。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-bp3exq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-bp3exq9","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药性论》：治男子女人软脚毒风,拘急挛痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-o9audcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-o9audcg","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《日华子本草》：治一切冷风，筋骨怯弱赢颤，入药炙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-ayrdx5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-ayrdx5q","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613095538-19ryke8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095538-19ryke8","updated":"20240613095538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613095540-jo4ax12","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613095540-jo4ax12"}},{"ID":"20240613095541-83ikp3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613095541-83ikp3s"}}]}